{"title": "Perilous Stakes", "pageid": 11920, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Perilous_Stakes", "categories": ["Class actions", "Intelligence saving throws", "Actions", "Bugs", "Illithid Powers", "Sources of healing"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the partial-illithid power. For the improved full-illithid version, see <a href=\"/wiki/Fierce_Perilous_Stakes\" title=\"Fierce Perilous Stakes\">Fierce Perilous Stakes</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Perilous_Stakes.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Perilous_Stakes.webp/300px-Perilous_Stakes.webp, /w/images/6/68/Perilous_Stakes.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Perilous_Stakes.webp/300px-Perilous_Stakes.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Perilous_Stakes.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Perilous Stakes</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">illithid power</a> which causes a creature to heal when it attacks at the cost of making it <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerable\">vulnerable</a> to all damage. Outside of <a href=\"/wiki/Honour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour\">Honour</a> mode, this can target any creature including enemies, but in Honour mode, it can only target allies.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nInvest a creature with power that heals it when it attacks, but also makes it <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerable\">Vulnerable</a> to all damage.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"INT Save (Spell save DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">INT</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Spell_save_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Spell save DC</a>)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 9 m (30 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 9 m (30 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 3  turns</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_TAD_PerilousStakes</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_TAD_PerilousStakes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_TAD_PerilousStakes\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=DisableBlood_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"DisableBlood (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">DisableBlood</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Perilous_Stakes\"> Condition: Perilous Stakes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perilous_Stakes_(Condition)\" title=\"Perilous Stakes (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perilous Stakes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Perilous_Stakes_(Condition)\" title=\"Perilous Stakes (Condition)\">Perilous Stakes</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 3  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"INT Save (Spell save DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">INT</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Spell_save_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Spell save DC</a>)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerable\">Vulnerable</a> to all damage, but when it attacks it heals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">2d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Unlock from the <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">illithid power</a> skill tree with a <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen\" title=\"Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen\">Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen</a> after obtaining the following:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Transfuse_Health\" title=\"Transfuse Health\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/25px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/38px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/50px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Transfuse Health\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/25px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Transfuse_Health\" title=\"Transfuse Health\">Transfuse Health</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>When cast on allies, there is no saving throw to apply the condition.</li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty#Honour\" title=\"Difficulty\">Honour mode</a>, this ability can only be cast on allies.\n<ul><li>To use this on an enemy in Honour Mode, it is possible to use an <a href=\"/wiki/Enchantment_(school)\" title=\"Enchantment (school)\">enchantment</a> spell such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dominate_Person\" title=\"Dominate Person\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Dominate_Person_Icon.webp/25px-Dominate_Person_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Dominate_Person_Icon.webp/38px-Dominate_Person_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Dominate_Person_Icon.webp/50px-Dominate_Person_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dominate Person\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Dominate_Person_Icon.webp/25px-Dominate_Person_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Dominate_Person_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dominate_Person\" title=\"Dominate Person\">Dominate Person</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dominate_Beast\" title=\"Dominate Beast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Dominate_Beast_Icon.webp/25px-Dominate_Beast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Dominate_Beast_Icon.webp/38px-Dominate_Beast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Dominate_Beast_Icon.webp/50px-Dominate_Beast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dominate Beast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Dominate_Beast_Icon.webp/25px-Dominate_Beast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Dominate_Beast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dominate_Beast\" title=\"Dominate Beast\">Dominate Beast</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Planar_Binding\" title=\"Planar Binding\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Planar_Binding_Icon.webp/25px-Planar_Binding_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Planar_Binding_Icon.webp/38px-Planar_Binding_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Planar_Binding_Icon.webp/50px-Planar_Binding_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Planar Binding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Planar_Binding_Icon.webp/25px-Planar_Binding_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Planar_Binding_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Planar_Binding\" title=\"Planar Binding\">Planar Binding</a> to make them an ally. It then becomes possible to apply Perilous Stakes and exploit the granted vulnerability.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perilous_Stakes_(Condition)\" title=\"Perilous Stakes (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perilous Stakes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Perilous_Stakes_(Condition)\" title=\"Perilous Stakes (Condition)\">Perilous Stakes</a> can be stacked multiple times upon the same character, providing multiple occurrences of healing without any additional negative effect.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715053328\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.085 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.089 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3771/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 57130/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 22657/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1510442/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.88%   73.903     43 Template:Trim\n100.00%   73.255      1 -total\n 99.16%   72.638      1 Template:Feature_page\n 21.74%   15.928     10 Template:Icon_text\n 16.04%   11.752      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 14.07%   10.309      1 Template:Condition\n 13.71%   10.040      6 Template:Icon_link\n 10.97%    8.038      1 Template:Resource\n 10.85%    7.950      4 Template:SAI\n  9.48%    6.947      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:11920-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715053328 and revision id 324655. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}